corpus/
artifacts/
# libFuzzer dumps a `slow-unit-<sha1>` file when an iteration crosses
# the `-report_slow_units` threshold (10s by default). Tiny inputs
# rarely exceed that, but the `fuzz_fca_full_pipeline` target does
# per-iteration tempdir + unarchive + cleanup, which is sensitive to
# transient host slowdowns (cold caches, AV scanners, Spotlight). The
# resulting files are environmental noise rather than diagnostic
# evidence — gitignore so they don't accumulate or accidentally land
# in a commit.
slow-unit-*
